// Package fuzzy is Encore's multi-language fuzzy matching library, used by the title matcher (internal/core/match). Its subpackages are small and independent: phonetic defines the Encoder interface and the language registry, and phonetic/en, phonetic/de, phonetic/fr, phonetic/es and phonetic/pt each provide one encoder and register it when imported. phonetic/ar builds the Arabic encoder on phonetic/en's Double Metaphone. tinyseg splits Japanese text into words for the matcher, a port of TinySegmenter under its BSD licence. loanword writes the Latin-script words of a title in katakana, Devanagari or Arabic letters, as Alexa's Japanese, Hindi and Arabic recognisers write them when they hear them, for the matcher's aliases and the skill model's synonyms.
package fuzzy
